{"seq":1,"slug":"apparel-size-ontology-schema","title":"服装尺码本体与属性 Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/product-attribute-size-ontology/apparel-size-ontology-schema","wordCount":2629,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"服装尺码本体与属性-schema-设计\">服装尺码本体与属性 Schema 设计</h1><p>一位跨境卖家把同一条裤子发布到五个站点，后台里它的尺码字段是五个互不相干的字符串：<code>M</code>、<code>38</code>、<code>10</code>、<code>M</code>、<code>170/76A</code>。买家在德国站看到 <code>38</code> 以为是欧码童装，在日本站看到 <code>M</code> 又和本地 <code>M</code> 对不上。真正的问题不在翻译，而在于这个字段从一开始就不是&quot;尺码&quot;，而是一段没有语义的文本。尺码本体的任务，就是把这段文本还原成一组<strong>可计算、可比较、可校验</strong>的结构化事实：它是哪个尺码系统、对应哪个人体维度、覆盖哪个区间、单位是什么、宽松量是多少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么尺码字段必须是结构而不是字符串\">为什么尺码字段必须是结构而不是字符串</h2><p>把 <code>M</code> 当作字符串存储，会立刻在四个环节失效。<strong>检索</strong>：买家搜&quot;胸围 100cm&quot;时无法命中，因为 <code>100</code> 这个数字不存在于数据里。<strong>比较</strong>：<code>M</code>、<code>38</code>、<code>170/76A</code> 无法排序，排序需要共同的度量轴。<strong>校验</strong>：无法回答&quot;这条裤子的臀围区间是否覆盖了这个买家的臀围&quot;，而这正是合身推荐的唯一依据。<strong>聚合</strong>：无法统计&quot;某个尺寸段的退货率&quot;，退货归因分析因此断裂。</p>\n<p>国际零售数据印证了这件事的分量。NRF 与 Happy Returns 的《2025 Retail Returns Landscape》（2025-10-15）估算，2025 年全美零售退货总额约 8499 亿美元，线上销售退货率约 19.3%，其中 9% 被判定为欺诈。NRF 口径下退货率最高的品类长期包含服装，而服装退货的首要原因始终是&quot;尺码/合身不符&quot;——尺码字段的结构化质量，直接作用于一个千亿量级的成本项。</p>\n<p>行业标准早已给出结构化方向。ISO 8559-1:2017 定义人体测量的人体学术语与测量程序，ISO 8559-2:2017 定义&quot;主维度（primary dimension）&quot;与&quot;次维度（secondary dimension）&quot;指标；它们取代了旧的 ISO 3635 系列，并吸收了欧洲标准 EN 13402 的前两部分（ISO 8559-1:2020 与 ISO 8559-2:2020 完成对 EN 13402-1/2 的替代）。这套标准的立场很明确：<strong>尺码标签应当承载人体尺寸，而不是承载一个约定俗成的符号</strong>。</p>\n<p>因此一个可用的尺码本体至少有四层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>承载内容</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>符号层</td>\n<td>面向买家的尺寸代码</td>\n<td><code>M</code>、<code>38</code>、<code>170/76A</code></td>\n<td>UI 无法展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统层</td>\n<td>该代码所属的尺码系统</td>\n<td><code>WearableSizeSystemCN</code>、<code>DE</code></td>\n<td>跨站误读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度量层</td>\n<td>对应的身体/成衣维度与区间</td>\n<td>胸围 98–102 cm</td>\n<td>无法匹配体型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构层</td>\n<td>版型、宽松量、弹力、可调范围</td>\n<td>修身 +4 cm ease</td>\n<td>推荐偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于：<strong>符号层是表现，度量层才是语义</strong>，映射与合身计算只能在度量层完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-主维度-次维度与-drop\">核心概念：主维度、次维度与 drop</h2><p>EN 13402-2 为每类服装指定一个&quot;主维度&quot;——标签必须依据的那一个身体测量值。男装用胸围，女装用胸围（bust）。当单一维度不足以选对商品时，可追加一到两个次维度，例如身高、腰围、臀围。EN 13402-3 给出了具体的取值与区间：男装标准胸围以 4 cm 步进，从 84 cm 到 144 cm，每个名义值覆盖一个区间（如 100 cm 对应 98–102 cm）。女性尺码的胸/腰围多以 4 cm 步进，大码扩大为 5 cm（臀）或 6 cm（胸、腰）。</p>\n<p>这套体系里最有计算价值的概念是 <strong>drop（落差）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">drop = g_{waist} - g_{chest}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。标准给出的男装基准体型为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">drop = -12\\ \\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>：胸围 100 cm 的成衣对应腰围 88 cm。但同一胸围可以搭配相邻腰围档位，覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> cm 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> cm 等体型。把 drop 建模为一等属性，直接解决了&quot;上衣合身但腰身不合身&quot;这类退货主因——它不再是版型缺陷，而是可检索、可筛选的结构化事实。</p>\n<p>落到数据模型上，一个度量维度应当由四个字段构成，缺一不可：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dimension</code>：受控词表枚举，如 <code>chest_girth</code>、<code>waist_girth</code>、<code>hip_girth</code></li>\n<li><code>value</code> + <code>unit</code>：数值与单位，永远成对出现（cm 或 in）</li>\n<li><code>interval</code>：名义值覆盖的上下界，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[v - \\delta/2,\\ v + \\delta/2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><code>applies_to</code>：标注这是<strong>身体维度</strong>还是<strong>成衣维度</strong>（garment measurement）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一项最容易被忽略，却最致命。ISO 8559 与 EN 13402 描述的是<strong>身体</strong>，而商品尺码表上印的往往是<strong>成衣平铺尺寸</strong>。成衣胸围 = 身体胸围 + 宽松量（ease）+ 面料弹力补偿。把两者混进同一个字段，会让推荐引擎系统性地偏小或偏大。schema.org 用两个不同的属性区分了这一点：<code>hasMeasurement</code> 描述<strong>产品本身</strong>的测量值（如裤子的内长），<code>suggestedMeasurement</code> 描述<strong>建议的人体</strong>测量区间。这个区分正是本体设计应当照搬的语义边界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[尺码符号 M / 38 / 170-76A] --&gt; B{所属尺码系统}&#10;    B --&gt;|WearableSizeSystemCN| C[GB/T 1335 中国码]&#10;    B --&gt;|WearableSizeSystemDE| D[EN 13402 欧码]&#10;    B --&gt;|WearableSizeSystemUS| E[US 字母码]&#10;    C --&gt; F[主维度: 胸围区间]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[次维度: 腰围/身高/臀围]&#10;    G --&gt; H[drop 落差计算]&#10;    H --&gt; I[换算为统一度量: cm 数值区间]&#10;    I --&gt; J[与买家体型区间求交]&#10;    J --&gt; K[合身判定 / 推荐尺码]\">graph TD\n    A[尺码符号 M / 38 / 170-76A] --&gt; B{所属尺码系统}\n    B --&gt;|WearableSizeSystemCN| C[GB/T 1335 中国码]\n    B --&gt;|WearableSizeSystemDE| D[EN 13402 欧码]\n    B --&gt;|WearableSizeSystemUS| E[US 字母码]\n    C --&gt; F[主维度: 胸围区间]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[次维度: 腰围/身高/臀围]\n    G --&gt; H[drop 落差计算]\n    H --&gt; I[换算为统一度量: cm 数值区间]\n    I --&gt; J[与买家体型区间求交]\n    J --&gt; K[合身判定 / 推荐尺码]</pre><p>所有尺码系统必须先<strong>下降到度量层</strong>（<code>I</code> 节点），才能做有意义的比较。在符号层做映射（<code>M</code> → <code>38</code>）看似直接，实则制造了不可维护的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 转换表，且无法表达&quot;区间重叠而非一一对应&quot;这一事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-schema-org-落地-sizespecification-与产品变体\">用 schema.org 落地：SizeSpecification 与产品变体</h2><p>schema.org 已经提供了一套可直接采用的词汇，2026 年当前版本中与服装尺码相关的类型集中在 <code>SizeSpecification</code> 及其枚举。<code>SizeSpecification</code> 继承自 <code>QualitativeValue</code>，定义了六个属性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>期望类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td>Text</td>\n<td>尺码代码本身（如 <code>3XL</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sizeSystem</code></td>\n<td><code>SizeSystemEnumeration</code> 或 Text</td>\n<td>尺码所属标准/国家/度量体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sizeGroup</code></td>\n<td><code>SizeGroupEnumeration</code> 或 Text</td>\n<td>目标人群分段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hasMeasurement</code></td>\n<td><code>QuantitativeValue</code></td>\n<td>产品本身测量值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>suggestedMeasurement</code></td>\n<td><code>QuantitativeValue</code></td>\n<td>建议人体测量区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>suggestedGender</code> / <code>suggestedAge</code></td>\n<td><code>GenderType</code> / <code>QuantitativeValue</code></td>\n<td>目标受众</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当前 schema.org 枚举可直接复用。<code>WearableSizeSystemEnumeration</code> 列出 22 个具体尺码系统，含 <code>US</code>、<code>UK</code>、<code>DE</code>、<code>FR</code>、<code>IT</code>、<code>JP</code>、<code>CN</code>、<code>BR</code>、<code>MX</code>、<code>AU</code>、<code>Continental</code> 等，以及 <code>SizeSystemMetric</code> / <code>SizeSystemImperial</code>。<code>WearableSizeGroupEnumeration</code> 提供 17 个分组值，含 <code>Mens</code>、<code>Womens</code>、<code>Boys</code>、<code>Girls</code>、<code>Infants</code>、<code>Juniors</code>、<code>Misses</code>、<code>Maternity</code>、<code>Plus</code>、<code>Petite</code>、<code>Big</code>、<code>Tall</code>、<code>Short</code>、<code>Regular</code> 等。<code>WearableMeasurementTypeEnumeration</code> 给出 13 个测量部位，含 <code>ChestOrBust</code>、<code>Waist</code>、<code>Hips</code>、<code>Inseam</code>、<code>Sleeve</code>、<code>Collar</code>、<code>Cup</code>、<code>Height</code>、<code>Length</code>、<code>Width</code> 等。</p>\n<p>这里有一个本体设计上的判断值得展开：<code>sizeGroup</code> 的枚举值（<code>Petite</code>、<code>Tall</code>、<code>Plus</code>）在欧美市场是版型分段，在中国和东南亚市场上几乎不出现。若强制该字段非空，跨境目录会大面积留空或填错。正确做法是把 <code>sizeGroup</code> 建模为可选字段，并区分&quot;缺失&quot;（<code>null</code>）与&quot;不适用&quot;（显式 <code>not_applicable</code>），而不是用空字符串含糊带过。本文定义的是静态本体，而如何用这些测量区间训练出可用的预测模型，见 <a href=\"../size-data-fit-model/size-chart-fit-prediction-model\">尺码表合身预测模型</a>。</p>\n<p>产品侧的变体结构由 <code>ProductGroup</code> 承载。<code>hasVariant</code> 指向各尺码的 <code>Product</code>，每个变体通过 <code>isVariantOf</code> 回指产品组，并各自携带一个 <code>SizeSpecification</code> 作为 <code>size</code>。这样&quot;同款不同码&quot;在数据层就是一次图遍历，而不是隐式的 SKU 命名约定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;ProductGroup&quot;,&#10;  &quot;productGroupID&quot;: &quot;SKU-PARENT-8842&quot;,&#10;  &quot;hasVariant&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Product&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;SKU-8842-BLK-M&quot;,&#10;      &quot;size&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;SizeSpecification&quot;,&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;M&quot;,&#10;        &quot;sizeSystem&quot;: &quot;WearableSizeSystemCN&quot;,&#10;        &quot;sizeGroup&quot;: &quot;WearableSizeGroupMens&quot;,&#10;        &quot;hasMeasurement&quot;: { &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;QuantitativeValue&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;chest&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 104, &quot;unitCode&quot;: &quot;CMT&quot; },&#10;        &quot;suggestedMeasurement&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;QuantitativeValue&quot;,&#10;          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;chest&quot;,&#10;          &quot;minValue&quot;: 98,&#10;          &quot;maxValue&quot;: 102,&#10;          &quot;unitCode&quot;: &quot;CMT&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"@type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ProductGroup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"productGroupID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-PARENT-8842\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hasVariant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-8842-BLK-M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"@type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SizeSpecification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"sizeSystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WearableSizeSystemCN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"sizeGroup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WearableSizeGroupMens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"hasMeasurement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"@type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"QuantitativeValue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">104</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unitCode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CMT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"suggestedMeasurement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"@type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"QuantitativeValue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"minValue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">98</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"maxValue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">102</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"unitCode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CMT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中 <code>hasMeasurement</code> 的 104 cm 与 <code>suggestedMeasurement</code> 的 98–102 cm 之差就是宽松量，被显式建模而非吞进一个模糊的&quot;偏大&quot;备注里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨系统映射-转换矩阵而非一对一字典\">跨系统映射：转换矩阵而非一对一字典</h2><p>跨境场景的尺码映射最容易做错。常见做法是维护一张 <code>M → 38 → 10 → M</code> 的对照表，但这是错的：<strong>不同系统的尺码是区间，不是点</strong>。女装 US 8 与 EU 38 各自覆盖一段身体尺寸，区间边界未必对齐，映射的正确形式是求交叠而非查表。三段式建模：<strong>归一化</strong>（把尺寸代码解析为统一 cm 区间，各国依 GB/T 1335.2-2008、JIS L 4005、KS K 0051、EN 13402-3）；<strong>求交</strong>（代码 A、B 可映射，当且仅当区间交叠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>overlap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{overlap}(I_A, I_B) \\ge \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">overlap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>）；<strong>标注置信度</strong>（交叠比例作为映射置信度输出，前端展示&quot;M ≈ 38（区间部分重叠）&quot;而非斩钉截铁的等号）。</p>\n<p>区间交叠可以形式化地写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">overlap(I_A, I_B) = \\frac{\\max(0,\\ \\min(u_A, u_B) - \\max(l_A, l_B))}{\\min(u_A - l_A,\\ u_B - l_B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pst