vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l,u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 为区间下界与上界。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">overlap = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时是包含关系，接近 0 说明两个代码几乎不覆盖同一体型——这类映射必须降级为&quot;不建议直接换算&quot;。</p>\n<p>字母码是全局最难处理的。EN 13402 并未规定 <code>S/M/L</code> 字母体系（第 4 部分编码系统草案曾被否决），字母码本质上是各国零售商的私有约定，因此<strong>不能</strong>在本体层做全局换算，只能作为符号层的展示别名，其真实语义必须由商品自身的尺码表提供。这正是&quot;符号层与度量层分离&quot;的实际价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本体演进与质量门\">本体演进与质量门</h2><p>尺码本体不是一次性建模，它必须随标准与商品一起演进，因此需要明确的三条工程纪律。</p>\n<p><strong>单位是第一等公民。</strong> 每个度量值必须带单位，推荐 UN/CEFACT 通用代码 <code>CMT</code>（厘米）与 <code>INH</code>（英寸）而非裸字符串。缺失单位在跨境场景几乎必然出错：<code>value: 40</code> 在 <code>CMT</code> 下是腰围，在 <code>INH</code> 下是裤内长。</p>\n<p><strong>区间而非点。</strong> 任何尺码表数值都应存为 <code>min/max</code> 或名义值 + 容差，因为制造公差与测量误差客观存在。EN 13402-3 的每个名义值都对应一个区间，本体应照此建模。点值会伪造出不存在的精度，让匹配算法在边界处误判。</p>\n<p><strong>受控词表 + 可扩展字段。</strong> <code>sizeSystem</code>、<code>sizeGroup</code>、<code>dimension</code> 使用枚举以支撑聚合与检索；同时保留 <code>additionalProperty</code>（<code>PropertyValue</code>）逃生通道，容纳尚未进入标准的品类特有属性，如&quot;杯型&quot;或&quot;裤型&quot;。对枚举值做严格白名单会逼商家把信息塞进描述文本，永久破坏可检索性。</p>\n<p>质量的最后一道门是<strong>可验证性</strong>。一条合格的尺码记录应通过三项自动校验：度量值有单位且维度在受控词表内；<code>suggestedMeasurement</code> 与 <code>hasMeasurement</code> 的差值（宽松量）落在该品类合理区间内；若声明了 <code>sizeSystem</code>，尺码代码必须能在该系统的已知代码集内找到。第三项尤其关键——它是唯一能在入库时拦住&quot;把欧码 38 当美码 38 上传&quot;这类跨境错误的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>回到开头的例子。当尺码从五个孤立字符串变成结构化的度量区间后，跨站发布不再是翻译问题，而是一次确定性的归一化；合身推荐不再是猜测，而是区间求交；退货归因不再断裂，因为&quot;买家买错码&quot;终于成了一个可以被查询和统计的事件。本文的属性 Schema 是体型数据建模、试穿推荐 UX 与退货治理运营三者的共同数据地基。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服装尺码本体与属性 Schema 设计","id":"服装尺码本体与属性-schema-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么尺码字段必须是结构而不是字符串","id":"为什么尺码字段必须是结构而不是字符串"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：主维度、次维度与 drop","id":"核心概念-主维度-次维度与-drop"},{"level":2,"text":"用 schema.org 落地：SizeSpecification 与产品变体","id":"用-schema-org-落地-sizespecification-与产品变体"},{"level":2,"text":"跨系统映射：转换矩阵而非一对一字典","id":"跨系统映射-转换矩阵而非一对一字典"},{"level":2,"text":"本体演进与质量门","id":"本体演进与质量门"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合身模型评估与偏差校正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/size-data-fit-model/fit-model-evaluation-bias-correction"},"next":{"title":"商品属性抽取与标准化流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/product-attribute-size-ontology/attribute-extraction-normalization-pipeline"}}